span><span class=\"date-num\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"date number\">18</span></button>\n<button class=\"date\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-4\" data-long=\"Jueves 19 de noviembre\" data-name=\"date button for Thursday 19\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"date-dow\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"day-of-week abbreviation\">Jue</span><span class=\"date-num\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"date number\">19</span></button>\n<button class=\"date\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-5\" data-long=\"Viernes 20 de noviembre\" data-name=\"date button for Friday 20\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"date-dow\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"day-of-week abbreviation\">Vie</span><span class=\"date-num\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"date number\">20</span></button>\n<button class=\"date\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-6\" data-long=\"Sábado 21 de noviembre\" data-name=\"date button for Saturday 21\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"date-dow\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"day-of-week abbreviation\">Sáb</span><span class=\"date-num\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-6-2\" data-name=\"date number\">21</span></button>\n<button class=\"date is-closed\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-7\" data-long=\"Domingo 22 de noviembre\" data-name=\"disabled closed date button for Sunday 22\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"date-dow\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-7-1\" data-name=\"day-of-week abbreviation\">Dom</span><span class=\"date-num\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-7-2\" data-name=\"date number\">22</span><span class=\"date-note\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-3-2-7-3\" data-name=\"closed note label\">Cerrado</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"field\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4\" data-name=\"hour field group\">\n<span class=\"field-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"hour field label\">Horario</span>\n<div class=\"times\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2\" data-name=\"time slot grid\" id=\"times\">\n<button class=\"time\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"time slot button 09:00\" type=\"button\">09:00</button>\n<button class=\"time\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"time slot button 10:30\" type=\"button\">10:30</button>\n<button class=\"time is-selected\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"time slot button 11:45 (selected)\" type=\"button\">11:45</button>\n<button class=\"time\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"time slot button 14:30\" type=\"button\">14:30</button>\n<button class=\"time\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-5\" data-name=\"disabled occupied time slot button 16:30\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Horario ocupado\" type=\"button\">16:30</button>\n<button class=\"time\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-1-4-2-6\" data-name=\"disabled occupied time slot button 18:00\" disabled=\"\" title=\"Horario ocupado\" type=\"button\">18:00</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<aside class=\"summary\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2\" data-name=\"sticky booking summary sidebar\" id=\"summary\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"booking summary title\">Tu reserva</h3>\n<div class=\"gold-rule\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"gold decorative rule\"></div>\n<div class=\"sum-row\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"summary service detail row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"summary service label\">Servicio</span>\n<span class=\"sum-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"summary service value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on service change\" id=\"sum-service\">Masaje Relajante Aleida</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sum-row\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"summary specialist detail row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"summary specialist label\">Especialista</span>\n<span class=\"sum-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"summary specialist value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on specialist change\" id=\"sum-specialist\">Carmen Sánchez</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sum-lines\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"summary detail lines group\">\n<div class=\"sum-line\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"summary date detail row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"summary date label\">Fecha</span>\n<span class=\"sum-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"summary date value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on date change\" id=\"sum-date\">Miércoles 18 de noviembre</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sum-line\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"summary time detail row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"summary time label\">Horario</span>\n<span class=\"sum-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"summary time value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on time change\" id=\"sum-time\">11:45</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sum-line\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"summary duration detail row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"summary duration label\">Duración</span>\n<span class=\"sum-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"summary duration value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on service change\" id=\"sum-duration\">90 min</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sum-total\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-6\" data-name=\"summary total price row\">\n<span class=\"sum-label\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"summary total label\">Total</span>\n<span class=\"total-val\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-6-2\" data-name=\"summary total price value\" data-reason=\"text replaced by render script on load and on service change\" id=\"sum-price\">S/ 280.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-continue\" data-kid=\"4-1-3-2-7\" data-name=\"continue booking button\" type=\"button\">Continuar reserva</button>\n</aside>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"trust\" data-kid=\"5\" data-name=\"trust badges bar\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"5-1\" data-name=\"trust content wrapper\">\n<div class=\"trust-grid\" data-kid=\"5-1-1\" data-name=\"trust items grid\">\n<div class=\"trust-item\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"trust item for medical biosecurity\"><i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\"></i>Bioseguridad médica</div>\n<div class=\"trust-item\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"trust item for private cabins\"><i class=\"ti ti-lock\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"lock icon\"></i>Cabinas privadas</div>\n<div class=\"trust-item\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3\" data-name=\"trust item for certified therapists\"><i class=\"ti ti-certificate\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"certificate icon\"></i>Terapeutas certificadas</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"6\" data-name=\"footer section\" id=\"contacto\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"6-1\" data-name=\"footer content wrapper\">\n<div class=\"footer-grid\" data-kid=\"6-1-1\" data-name=\"footer main grid\">\n<div class=\"footer-main\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer address and info block\">\n<span class=\"footer-name\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">Salon Spa Aleida</span>\n<p class=\"footer-line\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer address line\"><i class=\"ti ti-map-pin\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\"></i>Av. Conquistadores 450, Lima — Perú</p>\n<p class=\"footer-line\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"footer opening hours line\"><i class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>Lunes a Sábado, 09:00 – 20:00</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-contact\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer contact links block\">\n<a class=\"footer-link\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"phone contact link\" href=\"tel:+5114219876\"><i class=\"ti ti-phone\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"phone icon\"></i>(01) 421-9876</a>\n<a class=\"footer-link\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"WhatsApp contact link\" href=\"https://wa.me/51987654321\"><i class=\"ti ti-message-circle\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"message circle icon\"></i>WhatsApp 987 654 321</a>\n<a class=\"footer-link\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"email contact link\" href=\"mailto:contacto@salonspaaleida.com\"><i class=\"ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"mail icon\"></i>contacto@salonspaaleida.com</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-bottom\" data-kid=\"6-1-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom bar\">\n<span data-kid=\"6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer legal and tax ID text\">Salon Spa Aleida S.A.C. · RUC 20608192831</span>\n<span data-kid=\"6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">© 2026 Salon Spa Aleida</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var services = [\n    {name:'Masaje Relajante Aleida', dur:'90 min', price:'S/ 280.00'},\n    {name:'Facial Rejuvenecedor con Oro', dur:'75 min', price:'S/ 450.00'},\n    {name:'Tratamiento Capilar Keratina', dur:'120 min', price:'S/ 350.00'},\n    {name:'Manicura Spa Premium', dur:'60 min', price:'S/ 150.00'},\n    {name:'Corte y Peinado de Estilo', dur:'45 min', price:'S/ 120.00'}\n  ];\n  var state = {service:0, specialist:'Carmen Sánchez', date:'Miércoles 18 de noviembre', time:'11:45'};\n\n  function setText(id, val){ var el = document.getElementById(id); if(el){ el.textContent = val; } }\n\n  function render(){\n    var s = services[state.service];\n    setText('sum-service', s.name);\n    setText('sum-specialist', state.specialist);\n    setText('sum-date', state.date);\n    setText('sum-time', state.time);\n    setText('sum-duration', s.dur);\n    setText('sum-price', s.price);\n  }\n\n  var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.treat');\n  var sel = document.getElementById('service-select');\n\n  function selectService(idx, scroll){\n    state.service = idx;\n    for(var i=0;i<cards.length;i++){\n      var on = Number(cards[i].getAttribute('data-service')) === idx;\n      cards[i].classList.toggle('is-selected', on);\n      cards[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n    if(sel){ sel.value = String(idx); }\n    render();\n    if(scroll){\n      var target = document.getElementById('reserva');\n      if(target){ target.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth', block:'start'}); }\n      if(sel){ setTimeout(function(){ try{ sel.focus({preventScroll:true}); }catch(e){} }, 340); }\n    }\n  }\n\n  for(var c=0;c<cards.length;c++){\n    (function(card){\n      card.addEventListener('click', function(ev){\n        ev.preventDefault();\n        selectService(Number(card.getAttribute('data-service')), true);\n      });\n      card.addEventListener('keydown', function(ev){\n        if(ev.key === 'Enter' || ev.key === ' '){\n          ev.preventDefault();\n          selectService(Number(card.getAttribute('data-service')), true);\n        }\n      });\n    })(cards[c]);\n  }\n\n  if(sel){ sel.addEventListener('change', function(){ selectService(Number(sel.value), false); }); }\n\n  var sps = document.querySelectorAll('.specialist');\n  for(var p=0;p<sps.length;p++){\n    (function(row){\n      row.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        for(var k=0;k<sps.length;k++){ sps[k].classList.remove('is-selected'); }\n        row.classList.add('is-selected');\n        state.specialist = row.getAttribute('data-specialist');\n        render();\n      });\n    })(sps[p]);\n  }\n\n  var dates = document.querySelectorAll('.date');\n  for(var d=0;d<dates.length;d++){\n    (function(day){\n      day.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        if(day.disabled){ return; }\n        for(var k=0;k<dates.length;k++){ dates[k].classList.remove('is-selected'); }\n        day.classList.add('is-selected');\n        state.date = day.getAttribute('data-long') || day.textContent.trim();\n        render();\n      });\n    })(dates[d]);\n  }\n\n  var times = document.querySelectorAll('.time');\n  for(var t=0;t<times.length;t++){\n    (function(slot){\n      slot.addEventListener('click', function(){\n        if(slot.disabled){ return; }\n        for(var k=0;k<times.length;k++){ times[k].classList.remove('is-selected'); }\n        slot.classList.add('is-selected');\n        state.time = slot.textContent.trim();\n        render();\n      });\n    })(times[t]);\n  }\n\n  render();\n})();\n</script>",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-16T18:38:23.894477+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-16T18:40:21.936359+00:00",
      "id": "var_befaf2bb229f",
      "viewportScrollY": 0,
      "contentHeight": 2983
    },
    "var_92c65470c794": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "2 · Elige por duración",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 3570,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.48.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css');\n\n:root{\n  --forest:#2B573C;\n  --forest-deep:#22492F;\n  --sage:#4A7C59;\n  --sage-dark:#3F6B4C;\n  --mint:#F4FAF6;\n  --white:#FFFFFF;\n  --pale:#EBF5F0;\n  --gold:#D4AF37;\n  --ink:#183023;\n  --muted:#42634F;\n  --soft:#78977F;\n  --border:#CFE3D7;\n  --border-2:#E4F1E9;\n  --head:'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;\n  --body:'Outfit', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n\nbody{\n  margin:0;\n  padding-top:76px;\n  background:var(--mint);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--body);\n  font-size:16px;\n  line-height:1.6;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n}\nh1,h2,h3{margin:0;}\np{margin:0;}\na{color:inherit;}\nimg{display:block;}\nsection[id],footer[id]{scroll-margin-top:96px;}\n\n.wrap{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;}\n\n/* ---------- NAVBAR ---------- */\n.nav{\n  position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:76px;z-index:60;\n  background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(12px);\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);\n}\n.nav-in{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;height:76px;padding:0 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px;}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;}\n.mark{width:40px;height:40px;flex:0 0 40px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}\n.mark img{width:26px;height:26px;}\n.brand-name{font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.1875rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.005em;color:var(--ink);}\n.nav-links{display:flex;gap:32px;}\n.nav-links a{font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease;}\n.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--forest);border-bottom-color:var(--gold);}\n.nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;}\n.nav-phone{font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.nav-phone:hover{color:var(--forest);}\n\n.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:44px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid transparent;font-family:var(--body);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease,color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease;white-space:nowrap;}\n.btn-sage{background:var(--sage);color:#fff;}\n.btn-sage:hover{background:var(--sage-dark);}\n.btn-forest{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;}\n.btn-forest:hover{background:var(--forest-deep);}\n.btn-lg{height:48px;padding:0 28px;font-size:1rem;}\n.btn i{font-size:16px;}\n\n/* ---------- HERO ---------- */\n.hero{\n  box-sizing:border-box;min-height:456px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:34px 40px;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle at 16% 8%, #33664B 0%, #2B573C 46%, #22492F 100%);\n  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.5);\n}\n.hero-in{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:56px;}\n.hero-photo{margin:0;flex:0 0 360px;width:360px;height:340px;}\n.hero-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;}\n.hero-copy{margin-left:auto;max-width:670px;}\n.hero-copy h1{font-family:var(--head);font-size:3rem;line-height:1.16;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.015em;color:#fff;}\n.hero-copy p{margin-top:18px;max-width:560px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;line-height:1.75;color:#D7E9DE;}\n.hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px;}\n.hero-note{font-size:.875rem;color:#BCD3C5;}\n.hero-note a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.75);padding-bottom:1px;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.hero-note a:hover{color:#F3E7C0;}\n\n/* ---------- SECTION HEADS ---------- */\n.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;}\n.sec-head h2{font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;}\n.sec-head .rule{flex:1;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(to right,rgba(212,175,55,.6),rgba(207,227,215,.7));}\n\n/* ---------- CATALOGUE ---------- */\n.catalog{background:var(--mint);padding:48px 40px 56px;}\n.rail{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:30px;}\n.svc{\n  box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:274px;padding:20px;cursor:pointer;position:relative;\n  background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;\n  transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease;\n}\n.svc:hover{border-color:var(--sage);}\n.svc.is-sel{background:var(--pale);border-color:var(--sage);}\n.svc-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;}\n.dur{font-family:var(--head);font-size:2.125rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:lining-nums tabular-nums;}\n.dur .unit{margin-left:5px;font-family:var(--body);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--soft);}\n.check{position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sage);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:13px;opacity:0;transition:opacity 180ms ease;}\n.check i{font-size:13px;}\n.svc.is-sel .check{opacity:1;}\n.svc-name{margin-top:14px;font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.32;color:var(--ink);min-height:2.7em;}\n.svc-cat{margin-top:6px;font-size:.875rem;color:var(--muted);}\n.desc{display:none;margin-top:10px;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);}\n.svc.is-open .desc{display:block;}\n.svc-price{margin-top:auto;padding-top:18px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--sage);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.svc-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:10px;}\n.btn-details{align-self:flex-start;border:0;background:none;padding:0;font-family:var(--body);font-size:.875rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--border);text-underline-offset:3px;cursor:pointer;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.btn-details:hover{color:var(--forest);}\n.btn-card{height:40px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease;}\n.btn-card:hover{background:var(--mint);border-color:var(--sage);}\n.svc.is-sel .btn-card{border-color:var(--sage);background:#fff;}\n\n/* ---------- BOOKING ---------- */\n.booking{background:#fff;padding:64px 40px 72px;}\n.module{margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;}\n.svc-field{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:16px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);}\n.lab{display:block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft);}\n.svc-field-val{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}\n.svc-field-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.svc-field-meta strong{font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--forest);}\n.rule-v{width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--border);}\n\n.cal{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);}\n.cal-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n.cal-month{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}\n.cal-month span{min-width:158px;text-align:center;font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}\n.icon-btn{width:32px;height:32px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--muted);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color 180ms ease,color 180ms ease;}\n.icon-btn i{font-size:15px;}\n.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--sage);color:var(--forest);}\n.link-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:0;background:none;padding:0;font-family:var(--body);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--forest);cursor:pointer;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.link-btn i{font-size:16px;}\n.link-btn:hover{color:var(--sage-dark);}\n.cal-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;margin-top:16px;}\n.day{height:60px;padding:0;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;font-family:var(--body);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease,color 180ms ease;}\n.day .wd{font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);}\n.day .dn{font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.day:hover{border-color:var(--sage);}\n.day.is-sel{background:var(--forest);border-color:var(--forest);}\n.day.is-sel .wd{color:#CDE3D6;}\n.day.is-sel .dn{color:#fff;}\n.day.closed{background:#F7FBF8;border-style:dashed;cursor:default;}\n.day.closed .wd{color:#9DB4A6;}\n.closed-txt{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:500;color:#93AC9D;}\n\n.times{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);}\n.time-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px;align-items:center;max-width:880px;margin-top:12px;}\n.time-label{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--soft);}\n.slot{height:44px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;font-family:var(--body);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease,color 180ms ease;}\n.slot:hover{border-color:var(--sage);}\n.slot.is-sel{background:var(--forest);border-color:var(--forest);color:#fff;}\n\n.specs{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);}\n.spec-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px;}\n.spec{flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;font-family:var(--body);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 180ms ease,border-color 180ms ease;}\n.spec:hover{border-color:var(--sage);}\n.spec.is-sel{border-color:var(--sage);background:var(--pale);}\n.ava{width:44px;height:44px;flex:0 0 44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;}\n.spec-txt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;flex:1;}\n.s-name{font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}\n.s-role{font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}\n.radio{width:16px;height:16px;flex:0 0 16px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:50%;position:relative;transition:border-color 180ms ease;}\n.spec.is-sel .radio{border-color:var(--forest);}\n.spec.is-sel .radio::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:3px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--forest);}\n\n.summary{background:var(--pale);padding:18px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n.sum-fields{display:flex;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;padding:0;}\n.sum-fields dt{font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft);}\n.sum-fields dd{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}\n.sum-fields dd.tot{font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--forest);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n\n/* ---------- TRUST ---------- */\n.trust{background:var(--pale);padding:26px 40px;border-top:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,.4);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);}\n.trust-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:160px 1fr 160px;gap:36px;align-items:center;}\n.trust-photo{margin:0;width:160px;height:104px;}\n.trust-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:2px;}\n.trust-list{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:56px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n.trust-list li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}\n.trust-list i{font-size:18px;color:var(--sage);}\n\n/* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */\n.foot{background:var(--mint);padding:52px 40px 22px;}\n.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr 1fr;gap:48px;}\n.foot h3{font-family:var(--body);font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--soft);margin-bottom:14px;}\n.addr{margin-top:16px;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);}\n.h-row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:8px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-2);font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--muted);}\n.h-row strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}\n.foot-contact a{display:block;font-size:.9375rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:10px;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.foot-contact a:hover{color:var(--forest);}\n.foot-contact .phone{font-family:var(--head);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--forest);margin-bottom:12px;}\n.foot-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:36px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-2);font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--soft);}\n.foot-nav{display:flex;gap:20px;}\n.foot-nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;transition:color 180ms ease;}\n.foot-nav a:hover{color:var(--forest);}\n.sr-date{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}\n\n/* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */\n@media (max-width:1180px){\n  .rail{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));}\n  .hero-photo{flex:0 0 290px;width:290px;height:300px;}\n  .hero-copy h1{font-size:2.5rem;}\n  .nav-links{gap:22px;}\n}\n@media (max-width:1024px){\n  .hero-in{gap:36px;}\n  .hero-photo{flex:0 0 250px;width:250px;height:280px;}\n  .nav-phone{display:none;}\n  .trust-in{grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 120px;gap:24px;}\n  .trust-photo{width:120px;height:88px;}\n  .trust-list{gap:32px;}\n  .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;}\n}\n@media (max-width:860px){\n  .nav-links{display:none;}\n  .rail{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));}\n}\n@media (max-width:768px){\n  .nav-in{padding:0 20px;}\n  .catalog{padding:32px 20px 40px;}\n  .booking{padding:40px 20px 48px;}\n  .hero{padding:24px 20px 32px;min-height:0;}\n  .hero-in{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;}\n  .hero-photo{order:-1;flex:0 0 auto;width:100%;height:172px;}\n  .hero-copy{max-width:100%;}\n  .hero-copy h1{font-size:2.125rem;line-height:1.2;}\n  .hero-copy p{font-size:.9375rem;}\n  .sec-head h2{font-size:1.5rem;}\n  .rail{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:20px;}\n  .svc{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;grid-auto-rows:min-content;gap:4px 12px;min-height:0;padding:14px 16px;}\n  .svc-top{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;align-self:start;}\n  .dur{font-size:1.5rem;}\n  .check{display:none;}\n  .svc-name{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;margin-top:0;min-height:0;padding-right:10px;font-size:1rem;}\n  .svc-cat{grid-column:1;grid-row:2;margin-top:0;}\n  .desc{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:3;}\n  .svc-price{grid-column:2;grid-row:2;margin-top:0;padding-top:0;text-align:right;font-size:1.05rem;align-self:start;}\n  .svc-actions{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:4;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:10px;}\n  .btn-card{padding:0 16px;}\n  .svc-field{padding:14px 18px;gap:10px;}\n  .cal,.times,.specs{padding:18px;}\n  .cal-head{gap:12px;}\n  .cal-month span{min-width:0;font-size:1rem;}\n  .cal-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;}\n  .time-row{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;max-width:100%;}\n  .time-label{grid-column:1/-1;margin-top:6px;}\n  .spec{flex:1 1 100%;}\n  .summary{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:18px;padding:16px 18px;}\n  .sum-fields{gap:16px 28px;}\n  .summary .btn{width:100%;}\n  .trust{padding:24px 20px;}\n  .trust-in{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;}\n  .trust-photo{display:none;}\n  .trust-list{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:flex-start;gap:12px;}\n  .foot{padding:36px 20px 20px;}\n  .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;}\n  .foot-bottom{margin-top:24px;}\n}\n@media (max-width:520px){\n  .hero-copy h1{font-size:1.875rem;}\n  .cal-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));}\n  .day{height:56px;}\n  .brand-name{font-size:1.0625rem;}\n  .nav-in .btn{padding:0 16px;font-size:.875rem;}\n}\n</style>\n<header class=\"nav\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"fixed top navigation bar\">\n<div class=\"nav-in\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"navbar inner container\">\n<a class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"#top\">\n<span class=\"mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo mark box\"><img alt=\"Flor de loto de Salon Spa Aleida\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"zen lotus icon\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"26\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/frontend/public/logo_zen_icon.svg\" width=\"26\"/></span>\n<span class=\"brand-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name text\">Salon Spa Aleida</span>\n</a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Navegación principal\" class=\"nav-links\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"main navigation links\">\n<a data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"services nav link\" href=\"#servicios\">Servicios</a>\n<a data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"reserve nav link\" href=\"#reservar\">Reservar</a>\n<a data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"contact nav link\" href=\"#contacto\">Contacto</a>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"nav-right\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"navbar right group\">\n<a class=\"nav-phone\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"phone number link\" href=\"tel:+5114219876\">(01) 421-9876</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-sage\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"book appointment button\" href=\"#reservar\">Reservar Cita</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header>\n<section class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"hero section with forest gradient\" id=\"top\">\n<div class=\"hero-in\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"hero inner container\">\n<figure class=\"hero-photo\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero spa photo\">\n<img alt=\"Camilla de masaje con toalla enrollada en una cabina de spa con luz cálida. Fotografía: aiseleer / Pexels\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"spa massage table photograph\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"340\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36837602/pexels-photo-36837602.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" width=\"360\"/>\n</figure>\n<div class=\"hero-copy\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"hero copy block\">\n<h1 data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero headline\">Renueva tu Belleza, Equilibra tu Bienestar</h1>\n<p data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero descriptive paragraph\">En Salon Spa Aleida combinamos rituales terapéuticos botánicos, tratamientos faciales antiedad de última generación y estilismo capilar personalizado en un ambiente de calma, sofisticación y cuidado integral.</p>\n<div class=\"hero-actions\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero actions row\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-sage btn-lg\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"primary hero book-appointment button\" href=\"#reservar\">Reservar Cita</a>\n<span class=\"hero-note\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"hero phone note text\">Citas también al <a data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"hero phone number link\" href=\"tel:+5114219876\">(01) 421-9876</a></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"catalog\" data-kid=\"3\" data-name=\"services catalogue section\" id=\"servicios\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" data-kid=\"3-1\" data-name=\"catalogue section wrapper\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\" data-kid=\"3-1-1\" data-name=\"section header with title and rule\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"section title heading\">Servicios</h2>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"rule\" data-kid=\"3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"decorative gradient rule line\"></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"rail\" data-kid=\"3-1-2\" data-name=\"services grid rail\">\n<article class=\"svc\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hair service card\" data-service=\"corte\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"service card top row\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service duration display\">45<span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"minutes unit label\">min</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"check\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"selection check badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"svc-name\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"service name heading\">Corte y Peinado de Estilo</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"service category label\">Cuidado Capilar</p>\n<p class=\"desc\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"service description text\">Asesoría de visagismo personalizada, lavado con shampoo dermocosmético, corte de autor y estilizado profesional.</p>\n<p class=\"svc-price\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"service price\" data-reason=\"parent card is-sel class toggled by script on service selection\">S/ 120.00</p>\n<div class=\"svc-actions\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-6\" data-name=\"service actions group\">\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"btn-details\" data-details=\"corte\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"view details toggle button\" data-reason=\"textContent replaced by script to 'Ocultar'/'Ver detalles' on click\">Ver detalles</button>\n<button class=\"btn-card\" data-book=\"corte\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"book appointment for service button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"manicure service card\" data-service=\"manicura\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"service card top row\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"service duration display\">60<span class=\"unit\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"minutes unit label\">min</span></span>\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"check\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"selection check badge\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"svc-name\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"service name heading\">Manicura Spa Premium</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"service category label\">Manicura &amp; Pedicura</p>\n<p class=\"desc\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"service description text\">Exfoliación con sales minerales marinas, hidratación profunda con parafina tibia y esmaltado de alta duración.</p>\n<p class=\"svc-price\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-5\" data-name=\"service price\" data-reason=\"parent card is-sel class toggled by script on service selection\">S/ 150.00</p>\n<div class=\"svc-actions\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"service actions group\">\n<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"btn-details\" data-details=\"manicura\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"view details toggle button\" data-reason=\"textContent replaced by script to 'Ocultar'/'Ver detalles' on click\">Ver detalles</button>\n<button class=\"btn-card\" data-book=\"manicura\" data-kid=\"3-1-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"book appointment for service button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc is-sel\" data-kid=\