\"4-1-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"date summary value\" data-reason=\"textContent rewritten by script from selected date\" id=\"sumFecha\">Mié 18 nov</dd></div>\n<div data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"time summary row\"><dt data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"time summary label\">Hora</dt><dd data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"time summary value\" data-reason=\"textContent rewritten by script from selected time\" id=\"sumHora\">10:30</dd></div>\n<div data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-4\" data-name=\"specialist summary row\"><dt data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-4-1\" data-name=\"specialist summary label\">Especialista</dt><dd data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-4-2\" data-name=\"specialist summary value\" data-reason=\"textContent rewritten by script from selected specialist\" id=\"sumEspecialista\">Carmen Sánchez</dd></div>\n<div data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-5\" data-name=\"total summary row\"><dt data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-5-1\" data-name=\"total summary label\">Total</dt><dd class=\"tot\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-1-5-2\" data-name=\"total price value\" data-reason=\"textContent rewritten by script from selected service price\" id=\"sumTotal\">S/ 450.00</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<a class=\"btn btn-forest\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"continue booking button\" href=\"#reservar\">Continuar reserva <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"4-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"trust\" data-kid=\"5\" data-name=\"trust credentials strip\">\n<div class=\"trust-in\" data-kid=\"5-1\" data-name=\"trust strip inner layout\">\n<figure class=\"trust-photo\" data-kid=\"5-1-1\" data-name=\"left trust photo\">\n<img alt=\"Camilla de masaje con toalla y ventana con persianas de madera. Fotografía: Anna Tarazevich / Pexels\" data-kid=\"5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"spa massage table photograph\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6560308/pexels-photo-6560308.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" width=\"160\"/>\n</figure>\n<ul class=\"trust-list\" data-kid=\"5-1-2\" data-name=\"trust credentials list\">\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"biomedical safety credential item\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\"></i> Bioseguridad médica</li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"private cabins credential item\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-door\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"open door icon\"></i> Cabinas privadas</li>\n<li data-kid=\"5-1-2-3\" data-name=\"certified therapists credential item\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-certificate\" data-kid=\"5-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"certificate icon\"></i> Terapeutas certificadas</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"trust-photo\" data-kid=\"5-1-3\" data-name=\"right trust photo\">\n<img alt=\"Toallas blancas dobladas sobre una camilla de spa. Fotografía: Tima Miroshnichenko / Pexels\" data-kid=\"5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"folded spa towels photograph\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"104\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/6188050/pexels-photo-6188050.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=600&amp;q=80\" width=\"160\"/>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"foot\" data-kid=\"6\" data-name=\"footer section\" id=\"contacto\">\n<div class=\"wrap foot-grid\" data-kid=\"6-1\" data-name=\"footer grid layout\">\n<div class=\"foot-brand\" data-kid=\"6-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand column\">\n<a class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand logo link\" href=\"#top\">\n<span class=\"mark\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo mark box\"><img alt=\"Flor de loto de Salon Spa Aleida\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"zen lotus icon\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"26\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/frontend/public/logo_zen_icon.svg\" width=\"26\"/></span>\n<span class=\"brand-name\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name text\">Salon Spa Aleida</span>\n</a>\n<p class=\"addr\" data-kid=\"6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer address text\">Av. Conquistadores 450<br data-kid=\"6-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"line break\"/>Lima — Perú</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"6-1-2\" data-name=\"footer hours column\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"footer hours heading\">Horario</h3>\n<p class=\"h-row\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-2\" data-name=\"weekday hours row\"><span data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"weekday hours label\">Lunes a Sábado</span><strong data-kid=\"6-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"weekday hours time\">09:00 – 20:00</strong></p>\n<p class=\"h-row\" data-kid=\"6-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Sunday hours row\"><span data-kid=\"6-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Sunday hours label\">Domingo</span><strong data-kid=\"6-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Sunday closed label\">Cerrado</strong></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"foot-contact\" data-kid=\"6-1-3\" data-name=\"footer contact column\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"6-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer contact heading\">Contacto</h3>\n<a class=\"phone\" data-kid=\"6-1-3-2\" data-name=\"footer phone number link\" href=\"tel:+5114219876\">(01) 421-9876</a>\n<a data-kid=\"6-1-3-3\" data-name=\"WhatsApp number link\" href=\"https://wa.me/51987654321\">WhatsApp 987 654 321</a>\n<a data-kid=\"6-1-3-4\" data-name=\"contact email link\" href=\"mailto:contacto@salonspaaleida.com\">contacto@salonspaaleida.com</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wrap foot-bottom\" data-kid=\"6-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom bar\">\n<span data-kid=\"6-2-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice text\">© 2026 Salon Spa Aleida S.A.C. — RUC 20608192831</span>\n<span class=\"foot-nav\" data-kid=\"6-2-2\" data-name=\"footer bottom navigation\">\n<a data-kid=\"6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"footer services nav link\" href=\"#servicios\">Servicios</a>\n<a data-kid=\"6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"footer reserve nav link\" href=\"#reservar\">Reservar</a>\n</span>\n</div>\n</footer>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var MONTHS = ['enero','febrero','marzo','abril','mayo','junio','julio','agosto','septiembre','octubre','noviembre','diciembre'];\n  var MONTHS_S = ['ene','feb','mar','abr','may','jun','jul','ago','set','oct','nov','dic'];\n  var WD = ['Dom','Lun','Mar','Mié','Jue','Vie','Sáb'];\n  var SERVICES = {\n    corte: { name: 'Corte y Peinado de Estilo', min: 45, price: 120 },\n    manicura: { name: 'Manicura Spa Premium', min: 60, price: 150 },\n    facial: { name: 'Facial Rejuvenecedor con Oro', min: 75, price: 450 },\n    masaje: { name: 'Masaje Relajante Aleida', min: 90, price: 280 },\n    keratina: { name: 'Tratamiento Capilar Keratina', min: 120, price: 350 }\n  };\n  var SPECS = { carmen: 'Carmen Sánchez', luisa: 'Luisa Paredes', ana: 'Ana Vargas' };\n  var BASE = new Date(2026, 10, 16);\n  var state = { service: 'facial', dateIso: '2026-11-18', time: '10:30', spec: 'carmen', week: 0 };\n\n  function pad(n) { return (n < 10 ? '0' : '') + n; }\n  function iso(d) { return d.getFullYear() + '-' + pad(d.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + pad(d.getDate()); }\n  function money(n) { return 'S/ ' + n.toFixed(2); }\n  function fmtDate(key) {\n    var d = new Date(key + 'T00:00:00');\n    return WD[d.getDay()] + ' ' + d.getDate() + ' ' + MONTHS_S[d.getMonth()];\n  }\n  function byId(id) { return document.getElementById(id); }\n\n  function updateSummary() {\n    var s = SERVICES[state.service];\n    byId('sumServicio').textContent = s.name;\n    byId('sumFecha').textContent = fmtDate(state.dateIso);\n    byId('sumHora').textContent = state.time;\n    byId('sumEspecialista').textContent = SPECS[state.spec];\n    byId('sumTotal').textContent = money(s.price);\n    byId('svcFieldName').textContent = s.name;\n    byId('svcFieldDur').textContent = s.min + ' min';\n    byId('svcFieldPrice').textContent = money(s.price);\n  }\n\n  function renderDates() {\n    var strip = byId('calStrip');\n    var start = new Date(BASE.getFullYear(), BASE.getMonth(), BASE.getDate() + state.week * 7);\n    var dates = [];\n    for (var i = 0; i < 7; i++) {\n      dates.push(new Date(start.getFullYear(), start.getMonth(), start.getDate() + i));\n    }\n    var mid = dates[3];\n    byId('calMonth').textContent = MONTHS[mid.getMonth()].charAt(0).toUpperCase() + MONTHS[mid.getMonth()].slice(1) + ' ' + mid.getFullYear();\n\n    var inWeek = false;\n    var firstOpen = null;\n    dates.forEach(function (d) {\n      if (d.getDay() !== 0) {\n        if (!firstOpen) firstOpen = d;\n        if (iso(d) === state.dateIso) inWeek = true;\n      }\n    });\n    if (!inWeek && firstOpen) state.dateIso = iso(firstOpen);\n\n    strip.innerHTML = '';\n    dates.forEach(function (d) {\n      var closed = d.getDay() === 0;\n      var selected = !closed && iso(d) === state.dateIso;\n      var btn = document.createElement('button');\n      btn.type = 'button';\n      btn.className = 'day' + (closed ? ' closed' : '') + (selected ? ' is-sel' : '');\n      btn.disabled = closed;\n      if (closed) {\n        var wd = document.createElement('span');\n        wd.className = 'wd';\n        wd.textContent = 'Dom';\n        var ct = document.createElement('span');\n        ct.className = 'closed-txt';\n        ct.textContent = 'Cerrado';\n        btn.appendChild(wd);\n        btn.appendChild(ct);\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-label', WD[0] + ' ' + d.getDate() + ' cerrado');\n      } else {\n        var w = document.createElement('span');\n        w.className = 'wd';\n        w.textContent = WD[d.getDay()];\n        var n = document.createElement('span');\n        n.className = 'dn';\n        n.textContent = d.getDate();\n        btn.appendChild(w);\n        btn.appendChild(n);\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', selected ? 'true' : 'false');\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-label', WD[d.getDay()] + ' ' + d.getDate() + ' de ' + MONTHS[d.getMonth()]);\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n          state.dateIso = iso(d);\n          renderDates();\n          updateSummary();\n        });\n      }\n      strip.appendChild(btn);\n    });\n    updateSummary();\n  }\n\n  function markService() {\n    var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.svc');\n    for (var i = 0; i < cards.length; i++) {\n      var on = cards[i].getAttribute('data-service') === state.service;\n      cards[i].classList.toggle('is-sel', on);\n    }\n  }\n\n  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {\n    var details = e.target.closest('[data-details]');\n    if (details) {\n      var card = details.closest('.svc');\n      var open = card.classList.toggle('is-open');\n      details.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');\n      details.textContent = open ? 'Ocultar' : 'Ver detalles';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var book = e.target.closest('[data-book]');\n    if (book) {\n      state.service = book.getAttribute('data-book');\n      markService();\n      updateSummary();\n      var dest = byId('reservar');\n      if (dest) dest.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var slot = e.target.closest('[data-time]');\n    if (slot) {\n      state.time = slot.getAttribute('data-time');\n      var slots = document.querySelectorAll('.slot');\n      for (var i = 0; i < slots.length; i++) {\n        var on = slots[i] === slot;\n        slots[i].classList.toggle('is-sel', on);\n        slots[i].setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n      }\n      updateSummary();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var spec = e.target.closest('[data-spec]');\n    if (spec) {\n      state.spec = spec.getAttribute('data-spec');\n      var specs = document.querySelectorAll('.spec');\n      for (var j = 0; j < specs.length; j++) {\n        var sel = specs[j] === spec;\n        specs[j].classList.toggle('is-sel', sel);\n        specs[j].setAttribute('aria-pressed', sel ? 'true' : 'false');\n      }\n      updateSummary();\n      return;\n    }\n\n    var svc = e.target.closest('.svc');\n    if (svc) {\n      state.service = svc.getAttribute('data-service');\n      markService();\n      updateSummary();\n    }\n  });\n\n  byId('prevWeek').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    state.week -= 1;\n    renderDates();\n  });\n  byId('nextWeek').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    state.week += 1;\n    renderDates();\n  });\n\n  var dateInput = byId('dateInput');\n  byId('otherDate').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (typeof dateInput.showPicker === 'function') {\n      try { dateInput.showPicker(); return; } catch (err) { /* fallback */ }\n    }\n    dateInput.click();\n  });\n  dateInput.addEventListener('change', function () {\n    if (!dateInput.value) return;\n    var d = new Date(dateInput.value + 'T00:00:00');\n    if (d.getDay() === 0) return;\n    state.dateIso = iso(d);\n    var diff = new Date(d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth(), d.getDate()) - BASE;\n    state.week = Math.round(diff / 604800000);\n    renderDates();\n  });\n\n  markService();\n  renderDates();\n})();\n</script>",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-16T18:38:47.154761+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-16T18:39:38.632052+00:00",
      "id": "var_92c65470c794",
      "contentHeight": 2322
    },
    "var_f280dc1721bc": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "4 · Móvil · Carta de servicios",
      "parentId": "var_befaf2bb229f",
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 390,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\");\n@import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.48.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css\");\n\n:root{\n  --forest:#2B573C; --sage:#4A7C59; --mint:#F4FAF6; --pale:#EBF5F0;\n  --gold:#D4AF37; --ink:#183023; --muted:#42634F; --line:#CFE3D7; --line-soft:#E4F1E9;\n  --serif:\"Playfair Display\",Georgia,serif;\n  --sans:\"Outfit\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif;\n}\n*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0}\n.page{background:var(--mint);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:300;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n\n/* nav */\n.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\n  padding:0 16px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft)}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;text-decoration:none}\n.brand-tile{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--pale);border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center}\n.brand-tile img{width:24px;height:24px;display:block}\n.brand-name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.1;color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:.01em}\n.brand-sub{display:block;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-top:2px;font-weight:500}\n.nav-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}\n.icon-btn{width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;\n  display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--forest);font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .18s ease,color .18s ease}\n.icon-btn:hover{border-color:var(--sage);color:var(--sage)}\n\n.btn{font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:500;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s ease,color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.btn-solid{background:var(--sage);color:#fff;border-color:var(--sage)}\n.btn-solid:hover{background:var(--forest);border-color:var(--forest)}\n.btn-sm{padding:8px 13px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12.5px}\n\n/* hero */\n.hero{background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 20% 0%,#33664B 0%,#2B573C 52%,#22492F 100%);padding:18px 16px 26px}\n.hero-photo{height:148px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#1F3F2C}\n.hero-photo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}\n.hero h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:34px;line-height:1.14;letter-spacing:-.005em;\n  color:#fff;margin:20px 0 12px}\n.hero p{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#D8E8DE;max-width:34ch}\n.btn-hero{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;width:100%;padding:13px;\n  border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;background:var(--sage);color:#fff;border-color:var(--sage)}\n.btn-hero:hover{background:#3E6B4C}\n\n/* section furniture */\n.sec{padding:26px 16px 30px}\n.sec h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:23px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--ink)}\n.rule{height:1px;background:var(--line-soft)}\n\n/* service cards */\n.svc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:10px;padding:13px 14px;margin-bottom:9px;\n  transition:background-color .2s ease,border-color .2s ease}\n.svc.is-sel{background:var(--pale);border-color:var(--sage)}\n.svc-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}\n.svc h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.25;margin:0;color:var(--ink)}\n.svc-cat{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin:3px 0 7px;font-weight:500}\n.check{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;\n  flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px;color:transparent;font-size:11px}\n.svc.is-sel .check{background:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage);color:#fff}\n.svc-desc{margin:0 0 11px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted)}\n.svc-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}\n.svc-meta .dur{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.svc .price{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:var(--forest)}\n.btn-outline{width:100%;margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;\n  background:transparent;color:var(--forest);border-color:var(--line)}\n.btn-outline:hover{background:var(--forest);color:#fff;border-color:var(--forest)}\n\n/* booking */\n.booking{background:#fff;padding:26px 16px 30px}\n.lbl{display:block;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.11em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);\n  font-weight:500;margin:0 0 8px}\n.block{margin-bottom:18px}\n.sp{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;text-align:left;background:#fff;\n  border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:9px;padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:7px;cursor:pointer;\n  font-family:var(--sans);transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.sp img{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex:0 0 auto}\n.sp-txt{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.sp-name{display:block;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.25}\n.sp-role{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px;line-height:1.3}\n.radio{width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--line);flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;\n  place-items:center;color:transparent;font-size:11px}\n.sp.is-sel{background:var(--pale);border-color:var(--sage)}\n.sp.is-sel .radio{background:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage);color:#fff}\n\n.week{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;padding:2px 0 6px;margin:0 -16px;padding-left:16px;padding-right:16px;\n  scrollbar-width:none}\n.week::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n.day{flex:0 0 52px;height:54px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:9px;background:#fff;\n  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;cursor:pointer;\n  font-family:var(--sans);transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.day .dw{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.09em;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase}\n.day .dn{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--forest)}\n.day.is-sel{background:var(--forest);border-color:var(--forest)}\n.day.is-sel .dw{color:#CFE3D7}\n.day.is-sel .dn{color:#fff}\n.day.is-closed{background:#F7FCF9;border-style:dashed;cursor:default}\n.day.is-closed .dw,.day.is-closed .dn{color:#A9C3B3}\n.day .tag{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#A9C3B3;text-transform:uppercase}\n\n.slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:7px}\n.slot{height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease}\n.slot.is-sel{background:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage);color:#fff;font-weight:500}\n.slot.is-off{background:#F7FCF9;border-style:dashed;color:#B4CBBD;cursor:not-allowed}\n\n.summary{background:var(--pale);border-radius:12px;padding:15px 16px;margin-top:4px}\n.summary h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:17px;margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--forest)}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding:5px 0;font-size:12.5px}\n.row dt{color:var(--muted);margin:0;flex:0 0 auto}\n.row dd{margin:0;color:var(--ink);text-align:right;font-weight:400}\n.row.total{border-top:1px solid #D3E7DB;margin-top:8px;padding-top:10px;align-items:center}\n.row.total dt{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.row.total dd{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:21px;font-weight:600;color:var(--forest)}\n.btn-confirm{width:100%;margin-top:12px;padding:13px;border-radius:9px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;\n  background:var(--forest);color:#fff;border-color:var(--forest)}\n.btn-confirm:hover{background:#234A32}\n\n/* trust */\n.trust{background:var(--pale);padding:20px 16px 26px}\n.trust ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:12px}\n.trust li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:400}\n.trust i{font-size:16px;color:var(--sage)}\n\n/* footer */\n.footer{background:var(--mint);padding:26px 16px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--gold)}\n.footer .fname{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--ink)}\n.fblock{margin-bottom:14px}\n.fblock .fl{font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 4px}\n.fblock p{margin:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--ink)}\n.flink{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;\n  padding:4px 0;transition:color .18s ease}\n.flink:hover{color:var(--sage)}\n.flink i{font-size:14px;color:var(--sage)}\n.fbottom{margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);\n  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"page\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n<nav class=\"nav\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"main navigation bar\">\n<a class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"#inicio\">\n<span class=\"brand-tile\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand tile logo container\"><img alt=\"Flor de loto de Salon Spa Aleida\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shop lotus flower logo icon\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/frontend/public/logo_zen_icon.svg\"/></span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand text group\">\n<span class=\"brand-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name text\">Salon Spa Aleida</span>\n<span class=\"brand-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand tagline text\">Salón &amp; Spa</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n<div class=\"nav-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation actions group\">\n<button aria-label=\"Abrir menú\" class=\"icon-btn\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"menu hamburger button\" type=\"button\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-menu-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"menu hamburger icon\"></i></button>\n<button class=\"btn btn-solid btn-sm\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"nav booking call-to-action button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</div>\n</nav>\n<header class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"hero section\" id=\"inicio\">\n<div class=\"hero-photo\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero photo container\">\n<img alt=\"Camilla de masaje con toallas dobladas junto a una planta. Fotografía: aiseleer / Pexels\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"hero spa massage photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/36837602/pexels-photo-36837602.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=760&amp;q=80\"/>\n</div>\n<h1 data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero headline text\">Renueva tu Belleza, Equilibra tu Bienestar</h1>\n<p data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">Rituales terapéuticos botánicos, tratamientos faciales antiedad y estilismo capilar personalizado en un ambiente de calma y sofisticación.</p>\n<button class=\"btn btn-hero\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"hero primary booking button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon\"></i></button>\n</header>\n<section class=\"sec\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"services section\" id=\"servicios\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"services section heading\">Carta de servicios</h2>\n<article class=\"svc is-sel\" data-dur=\"90 min\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"service card (relaxing massage)\" data-price=\"S/ 280.00\" data-service=\"Masaje Relajante Aleida\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"service card header row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"service title group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service card title\">Masaje Relajante Aleida</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service category label\">Spa &amp; Bienestar</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"check\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection checkmark circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"svc-desc\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"service description text\">Terapia antiestrés con aceites botánicos, aromaterapia personalizada y piedras calientes para disolver tensiones acumuladas.</p>\n<div class=\"svc-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"service meta row (duration &amp; price)\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"service duration label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>90 min</span>\n<span class=\"price\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"service price text\">S/ 280.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"service book appointment button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc\" data-dur=\"75 min\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"service card (gold facial)\" data-price=\"S/ 450.00\" data-service=\"Facial Rejuvenecedor con Oro\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"service card header row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"service title group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service card title\">Facial Rejuvenecedor con Oro</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service category label\">Estética Facial</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"check\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection checkmark circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"svc-desc\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"service description text\">Limpieza profunda e hidratación intensiva con micropartículas de oro coloidal y colágeno hidrolizado purificado.</p>\n<div class=\"svc-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3\" data-name=\"service meta row (duration &amp; price)\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"service duration label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>75 min</span>\n<span class=\"price\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2\" data-name=\"service price text\">S/ 450.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-4\" data-name=\"service book appointment button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc\" data-dur=\"120 min\" data-kid=\"1-3-4\" data-name=\"service card (keratin treatment)\" data-price=\"S/ 350.00\" data-service=\"Tratamiento Capilar Keratina\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"service card header row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"service title group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service card title\">Tratamiento Capilar Keratina</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service category label\">Cuidado Capilar</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"check\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection checkmark circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"svc-desc\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"service description text\">Nutrición intensiva con sellado térmico para eliminación total del frizz y brillo prolongado de calidad profesional.</p>\n<div class=\"svc-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"service meta row (duration &amp; price)\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"service duration label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>120 min</span>\n<span class=\"price\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-3-2\" data-name=\"service price text\">S/ 350.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-3-4-4\" data-name=\"service book appointment button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc\" data-dur=\"60 min\" data-kid=\"1-3-5\" data-name=\"service card (premium manicure)\" data-price=\"S/ 150.00\" data-service=\"Manicura Spa Premium\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"service card header row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1\" data-name=\"service title group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service card title\">Manicura Spa Premium</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service category label\">Manicura &amp; Pedicura</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"check\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection checkmark circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"svc-desc\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-2\" data-name=\"service description text\">Exfoliación con sales minerales marinas, hidratación profunda con parafina tibia y esmaltado de alta duración.</p>\n<div class=\"svc-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3\" data-name=\"service meta row (duration &amp; price)\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1\" data-name=\"service duration label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>60 min</span>\n<span class=\"price\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-3-2\" data-name=\"service price text\">S/ 150.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-3-5-4\" data-name=\"service book appointment button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</article>\n<article class=\"svc\" data-dur=\"45 min\" data-kid=\"1-3-6\" data-name=\"service card (haircut &amp; styling)\" data-price=\"S/ 120.00\" data-service=\"Corte y Peinado de Estilo\">\n<div class=\"svc-top\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1\" data-name=\"service card header row\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1\" data-name=\"service title group\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service card title\">Corte y Peinado de Estilo</h3>\n<p class=\"svc-cat\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service category label\">Cuidado Capilar</p>\n</div>\n<span class=\"check\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2\" data-name=\"service selection checkmark circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-1-2-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"svc-desc\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-2\" data-name=\"service description text\">Asesoría de visagismo personalizada, lavado con shampoo dermocosmético, corte de autor y estilizado profesional.</p>\n<div class=\"svc-meta\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-3\" data-name=\"service meta row (duration &amp; price)\">\n<span class=\"dur\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-3-1\" data-name=\"service duration label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-3-1-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\"></i>45 min</span>\n<span class=\"price\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-3-2\" data-name=\"service price text\">S/ 120.00</span>\n</div>\n<button class=\"btn btn-outline\" data-kid=\"1-3-6-4\" data-name=\"service book appointment button\" type=\"button\">Reservar Cita</button>\n</article>\n</section>\n<section class=\"booking\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"booking section\" id=\"reservar\">\n<h2 data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"booking section heading\" style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:23px;margin:0 0 18px\">Reserva tu cita</h2>\n<div class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"especialista selection block\">\n<span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"especialista field label\">Especialista</span>\n<button class=\"sp is-sel\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"especialista option card (Carmen)\" data-sp=\"Carmen Sánchez\" type=\"button\">\n<img alt=\"Carmen Sánchez. Fotografía: xandro Vandewalle / Unsplash\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"especialista avatar photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586165127014-f730957751f2?auto=format&amp;w=120&amp;h=120&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"sp-txt\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"especialista text group\">\n<span class=\"sp-name\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"especialista name\">Carmen Sánchez</span>\n<span class=\"sp-role\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"especialista role title\">Cosmiatra &amp; Terapeuta Holística</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"radio\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"especialista selection radio circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"sp\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"especialista option card (Luisa)\" data-sp=\"Luisa Paredes\" type=\"button\">\n<img alt=\"Luisa Paredes. Fotografía: Rendy Novantino / Unsplash\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"especialista avatar photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1620198361326-a319ba24ec94?auto=format&amp;w=120&amp;h=120&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"sp-txt\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"especialista text group\">\n<span class=\"sp-name\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"especialista name\">Luisa Paredes</span>\n<span class=\"sp-role\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"especialista role title\">Estilista Capilar Senior</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"radio\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"especialista selection radio circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"sp\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"especialista option card (Ana)\" data-sp=\"Ana Vargas\" type=\"button\">\n<img alt=\"Ana Vargas. Fotografía: Maria Isadora / Pexels\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"especialista avatar photo\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/18090215/pexels-photo-18090215.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=120&amp;h=120&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80\"/>\n<span class=\"sp-txt\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"especialista text group\">\n<span class=\"sp-name\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"especialista name\">Ana Vargas</span>\n<span class=\"sp-role\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"especialista role title\">Especialista en Manicura &amp; Pedicura</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"radio\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-3\" data-name=\"especialista selection radio circle\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon\"></i></span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-4-3\" data-name=\"date selection block\">\n<span class=\"lbl\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"date field label\">Fecha · Noviembre 2026</span>\n<div class=\"week\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"week day strip container\" id=\"week\">\n<button class=\"day\" data-date=\"Lun 16 de noviembre\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"day button (Monday 16)\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"dw\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"day weekday label\">Lun</span><span class=\"dn\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"day date number\">16</span></button>\n<button class=\"day\" data-date=\"Mar 17 de noviembre\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"day button (Tuesday 17)\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"dw\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"day weekday label\">Mar</span><span class=\"dn\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"day date number\">17</span></button>\n<button class=\"day is-sel\" data-date=\"Mié 18 de noviembre\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3\" data-name=\"day button (Wednesday 18)\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"dw\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"day weekday label\">Mié</span><span class=\"dn\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"day date number\">18</span></button>\n<button class=\"day\" data-date=\"Jue 19 de novie